 kit tools - lists, installs, and updates what the chosen toolchain and the dependencies pin

   one of
   *kit tools*                 lists, installs, and updates what the chosen toolchain and the
                             dependencies pin

     --outdated              only the tools behind their latest version; reaches the network

     --check                 with --outdated: fails when any tool is behind

     --toolchain             uses this toolchain for the run, as KIT_TOOLCHAIN does; kit takes it
                             even after run's command

     --json   --jq           one JSON object per tool: name, pinned, installed, latest with
                             --outdated, and from

   --toolchain (install | update | path | run <command>…)


 kit tools
